<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PacifiCorp upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PacifiCorp upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal &amp; Co said on Thursday it raised its rating on the shares of Pacificorp to buy from hold, following news PacifiCorp had started a process to acquire Britain's Energy Group plc.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Penelope Adelmann said in a research note investors looking for aggressive growth should buy shares of PacifiCorp, and that her earnings estimates were under review.</p>
<p>-- Energy Group said on Tuesday it was in talks with PacifiCorp which could lead to a recommended offer being made for it. PacifiCorp declined to comment on the announcment.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Terms of the deal are still uncertain, but the total package can give PacifiCorp an aggressive and definitive competitive stance which it was previously lacking,&quot; she said.</p>
<p>-- PacifiCorp shares were up 1/8 at 21-7/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
